#: b7841f98976b4d049ddcb2ca62e35b5e
msgid "The lidar should be mounted horizontally on the top or bottom of the vehicle with the arrow on top of the unit pointing towards the front of the vehicle. Ensure the sensor's view is not obstructed by any portion of the vehicle including GPS mast, vehicle legs etc."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-ld06.rst:38
#: f2d5334d5de34d66ac1a8cba2ff098e4
msgid "The lidar can be connected to the autopilot's serial input as shown above. If using a Pixhawk/Pixhawk 2.1 (CubePilot CubeBlack) Telem1 (aka Serial1) should be used because it is more capable of providing the required power."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-ld06.rst:41
#: eaf375ee55c74f4696e16f157531ea85
msgid "only the Lidar's TX pin is used. Its pwm motor control input pin is not connected and the lidar will spin at a default rate (reported in its telemetry back to the autopilot)."
